-- Earnings at or below 68,500 x 6/12 = 34,250 : the exemption is 3,500 x 6/12.
#ASSERT `s 19 — the basic exemption of a person for a year` `person whose retirement pension becomes payable on 1 July 2024` 3_500 68_500 30_000 EQUALS JUST 1_750
#ASSERT `s 19 — the basic exemption of a person for a year` `person whose retirement pension becomes payable on 1 July 2024` 3_500 68_500 34_250 EQUALS JUST 1_750   -- equal : not "exceeds"
#ASSERT `s 19 — the basic exemption of a person for a year` `person whose retirement pension becomes payable on 1 July 2024` 3_500 68_500 35_000 EQUALS JUST 2_500   -- (ii) 750 is less than (i) 1,750
#ASSERT `s 19 — the basic exemption of a person for a year` `person whose retirement pension becomes payable on 1 July 2024` 3_500 68_500 50_000 EQUALS JUST 3_500   -- (i) 1,750 is less than (ii) 15,750
#ASSERT `s 19 — the basic exemption of a person for a year` `same person with an election made on 12 August 2024` 3_500 68_500 50_000 EQUALS JUST (7_000 DIVIDED BY 3)   -- election in effect September to December (4 months): (i) = 3,500 x (6 - 4)/12
#ASSERT `s 19 — the basic exemption of a person for a year` `same person with January and February excluded by disability` 3_500 68_500 20_000 EQUALS JUST (3_500 DIVIDED BY 3)   -- (6 - 2) months of 12 ; earnings 20,000 are below 68,500 x 4/12
#ASSERT `s 19 — the basic exemption of a person for a year` `person aged 70 whose retirement pension becomes payable on 1 March 2024` 3_500 68_500 20_000 EQUALS JUST (1_750 DIVIDED BY 3)   -- 2 months before ; (i) is nil : all 10 paid months are after the 70th birthday
#ASSERT `s 19 — the basic exemption of a person for a year, determined without taking into account paragraphs (b) and (c)` `person whose retirement pension becomes payable on 1 July 2024` 3_500 68_500 50_000 EQUALS JUST 3_500   -- (d) is kept when (b) and (c) are left out
#ASSERT `s 19(d) — the basic exemption for a year in which a retirement pension becomes payable` `person with the retirement pension payable since 2023` 3_500 68_500 50_000 EQUALS NOTHING   -- it did not become payable in 2024
#ASSERT `s 19(d) — the basic exemption for a year in which a retirement pension becomes payable` `plain person 1980` 3_500 68_500 50_000 EQUALS NOTHING   -- no retirement pension payable
#ASSERT `s 19 — the basic exemption of a person for a year` `person with the retirement pension payable since 2023` 3_500 68_500 50_000 EQUALS JUST 3_500   -- falls back to (a) to (c): nothing happens in 2024

